00:00:23.086 --> 00:00:24.460
You got a preview
of some of what

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.370
we're going to be talking about
in this session in Prabhakar's

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.290
keynote earlier this morning.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.510
This is a very big
day for Google Drive.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.590
This is certainly the
biggest day for Google Drive

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.190
