00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.340
IT leaders, analysts,
and others--

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.710
understanding what your
fundamental enterprise

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:54.100
requirements are for
not just enterprise

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.650
file sync and share
systems, but really your

00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:02.710
needs for content management and
content discovery in the cloud.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:06.030
We've invested, no
exaggeration here,

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:10.130
hundreds of engineering
years over the last few years

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.820
building out the capabilities
that you need to take advantage

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.074
