00:49:29.990 --> 00:49:32.150
So, of course, with
Drive File Stream,

00:49:32.150 --> 00:49:36.962
I have access to all of my
Team Drive content as well.

00:49:36.962 --> 00:49:39.420
And I'm going to go ahead and
double-click into Team Drives

00:49:39.420 --> 00:49:41.940
