single file in advance.

00:49:59.070 --> 00:50:02.219
But as an end user, I'd like
to open this launch plan,

00:50:02.219 --> 00:50:04.510
but as an end user, I don't
have to learn anything new.

00:50:04.510 --> 00:50:06.260
I can just go ahead
and double-click on it

00:50:06.260 --> 00:50:08.370
and it opens up in Word,
just like I'd expect.

00:50:08.370 --> 00:50:09.745
So I'm going to
go ahead and make

00:50:09.745 --> 00:50:15.200
