document, hit the Save button,

00:50:15.200 --> 00:50:15.757
and close it.

00:50:15.757 --> 00:50:16.340
And that's it.

00:50:16.340 --> 00:50:17.965
So I didn't have to
learn anything new.

00:50:17.965 --> 00:50:19.910
And the latest version
of this Word document

00:50:19.910 --> 00:50:22.236
is going to get uploaded
back to our Team Drive

00:50:22.236 --> 00:50:24.860
and Diane will see it next time
that she enters the Team Drive.

00:50:27.790 --> 00:50:29.560
And this entire
folder, actually,

00:50:29.560 --> 00:50:31.480
